      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”……不曾见过的秋季。\n新宇宙朝向崭新的道路迈出步伐。\n她对战的是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed88084098d4f4a4169e170e381c4c9d11e62628564373523c2c7f0690fdc553",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
