    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72342fc238bbb52155f770d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以秋古马三冠为目标的荒漠英雄。\n如果新宇宙赢了，便会阻碍她实现梦想。\n英雄笑说，即使如此也希望一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eece33f18eda662eb27ed97b9ad5ea9833edaf5fbc64c391fb47cd83b58a9ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
