    {
      "uid": "zhcn:066d989946833a09c1b2cfaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“GATE”指的是“天皇赏（春）”，\n也是新宇宙要克服的障碍。\n她必须走到“GATE”的另一端。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8c4cfc5d112637870790e9c9a4b3f4824204d37dbd3bd3c56ad1551ec4669c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
