    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce5a52358b0b4986d0a00d32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（春）”是顶尖的长距离竞赛。\n为了克服这个关卡，首先要经过主流路线。\n因此两人决定下一个目标是“皋月赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f63325bc419e78cb1203230fb99f1ad7022aef7e49162499b822a5f59b03837b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105420.json",
      "json_path": [
