    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c33ae85e50bcf8b8301df88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标是“日本德比”，然而──\n新宇宙“预知”当天是“雨天”，\n而且会与训练员“分离”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "162b5981c4e5a3e4d64a6c7adbb88a5c69debc803c1b10bbf30a67655d795270",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350497ddd821d99a8c997c13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她以我没有抵达赛场为前提，\n告诉我──一定要来“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8042f3852a3da81554be45c5a2e5ad18e2fed63e379fe24797fa04a8d5713d19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
